== Trivia ==
* Larynx is the medical term for the voice box, the organ that holds the vocal cords in mammals.
* '''Larynx''', {{I|Everything Jar}}, {{I|Notched Axe}}, and {{I|Spin to Win}} are the only activated items that can be used when not fully charged.
* '''Larynx''', {{i|Alabaster Box}}, {{i|Berserk!}}, {{i|Eden's Soul}}, and {{i|Everything Jar}} are the only activated items that are not fully charged on first pickup.

